    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3cf7569b6a485e8d13e8d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 08:53:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 钱，原来你如此重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 大学时期流行风尚大盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 谁还没记过账呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 可以买贵的，不能买贵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 一定要省的钱和一定不能省的钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 直播间的前世或许是电视购物吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>番外：早上剪辑节目的同时，十七发来一份很应景的真实案例</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3MVSWlvFtBMAPJGp1zomET-j7X.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
