  <item>
    <title>【移动日常】2024新年快乐！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65912e89ed98191e9b95b1b2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65912e89ed98191e9b95b1b2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们突发奇想录了一个年终盘点一样的节目！实在是觉得2023年发生了太多事情，这样小小复盘一下看到自己确实进步了，会有一种安心的感觉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接下来的2024也希望能继续做自由人！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 今年新学会的技能是！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a>今年最大开销或花的最值的一笔钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 今年的新尝试 ！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 愿望实现时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 幸运时刻！&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 乌龙/糟心时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 今年自己最大的变化是？</span></p>]]></description>
